## Key Features

### 🔐 Authentication & Security
- JWT-based authentication (15-min access token, 7-day refresh token)
- BCrypt password hashing with salt
- Role-based authorization (Passenger, Driver, Admin)
- Refresh token rotation and revocation
- Rate limiting on auth endpoints
- CORS configured for Flutter frontend

### 👤 User Management
- Passenger and Driver registration with validation
- Pakistani phone number and CNIC format validation
- Profile management and updates
- User status tracking (Pending, Active, Suspended, Rejected)
- Email and phone uniqueness enforcement
- Account suspension and reactivation

### 📄 Document Management & KYC
- Secure file upload (PDF, JPG, PNG, max 10MB)
- Document type tracking (CNIC, Driving License, etc.)
- Admin approval/rejection workflow
- Automatic user verification on document approval
- Document download with authorization
- Rejection reason tracking

### 🚗 Rides & Bookings
- Ride creation with seat capacity and pricing
- Advanced ride search with filters (location, date, seats)
- Booking request workflow (Pending → Accepted → Completed)
- Seat availability with **concurrency safety**
- Automatic race condition handling with retry logic
- Booking cancellation with notifications
- Driver and passenger rating system

### 💬 Chat & Messaging
- REST-based real-time messaging (no SignalR needed)
- Message read tracking
- Unread message count
- Chat thread management
- Only active bookings can have messages
- Automatic message fetching for mobile apps

### 🚨 Safety Features
- **SOS Emergency Alerts** - Quick emergency contact
- **Complaint Filing** - Passengers can report driver behavior
- **Admin Resolution** - Track and resolve incidents
- **Audit Trail** - Notes and resolution history
- Status tracking (Reported, Acknowledged, Resolved)

### 💳 Payment & Wallet Management
- Automatic 20% service fee calculation
- Payment receipt upload (PDF/image, max 5MB)
- Admin approval workflow
- Driver wallet with real-time balance
- Earnings reports and transaction history
- Payment method tracking (EasyPaisa, JazzCash, Bank Transfer)
- Reconciliation reports

### 📊 Admin Dashboard
- **Statistics Dashboard**:
  - User count (total, passengers, drivers)
  - Pending verifications
  - Active and completed rides
  - Revenue metrics
  - Open complaints and SOS alerts

- **User Management**:
  - Approve/reject registrations
  - Suspend/reactivate users
  - View user documents

- **Document Management**:
  - Review pending documents
  - Approve/reject with reasons
  - Track verification status

- **Payment Management**:
  - Review submitted payments
  - Approve/reject receipts
  - Revenue analytics

- **Incident Management**:
  - View and resolve SOS alerts
  - Manage complaints
  - Update status with notes

### 📝 Additional Features
- Global exception handling with proper HTTP status codes
- Structured logging (Information, Warning, Error levels)
- Pagination support for list endpoints
- Swagger/OpenAPI documentation
- Role-based endpoint access
- Soft deletes for audit trail
- Timestamp tracking (CreatedAt, UpdatedAt)

