## Deployment

### Production Checklist

- [ ] Update `appsettings.Production.json`
- [ ] Configure production SQL Server connection
- [ ] Generate strong JWT secret key (32+ characters)
- [ ] Set file storage path (network share or cloud storage)
- [ ] Enable HTTPS and configure SSL certificate
- [ ] Set CORS origins to production domain
- [ ] Configure logging to track production issues
- [ ] Set up database backups
- [ ] Create and migrate production database
- [ ] Test all critical endpoints
- [ ] Configure application monitoring
- [ ] Set up error tracking (e.g., Sentry)

### Deploy to IIS

```bash
# Build release
dotnet publish -c Release -o ./publish

# Configure IIS:
# 1. Create new site pointing to publish folder
# 2. Set application pool to .NET CLR version (No Managed Code)
# 3. Configure bindings (HTTPS)
# 4. Set environment variables:
#    - ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT=Production
#    - Connection string
#    - JWT secret
```

### Deploy to Azure App Service

```bash
# Create resource group
az group create --name SafeSeatedRG --location eastasia

# Create App Service plan
az appservice plan create --name SafeSeatedPlan --resource-group SafeSeatedRG --sku B1

# Create web app
az webapp create --name safeseated-api --plan SafeSeatedPlan --resource-group SafeSeatedRG

# Configure app settings
az webapp config appsettings set --name safeseated-api --resource-group SafeSeatedRG \
  --settings ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT=Production

# Publish
dotnet publish -c Release
# Upload publish folder to Azure
```

